<title>USA: Gulfstream narrows expected price range for IPO.</title>
<headline>Gulfstream narrows expected price range for IPO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gulfstream Aerospace Corp narrowed the expected price range for its initial public offering to $22 to $24 a share, from a previous range of $21 to $25 a share, according to a U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission filing.</p>
<p>The corporate jet manufacturer's 28 million share offering is expected in early October, according to the underwriter.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
